# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MIT 6.3930 project .gitignore
#
# Deliberately NARROW.  Do NOT add blanket rules for *.fasta, *.csv, *.npz or
# emb/ -- the cohort FASTAs, manifests, result tables and pooled ESM-2
# embeddings are tracked on purpose.  Every exclusion below names a specific
# path and is justified in REPO_SETUP.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- macOS metadata --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Python caches / environments -----------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- Credentials (never commit) -------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
.netrc
.huggingface/
**/secrets.*
**/credentials.*
*token*.txt

# --- Redundant upstream release archive -----------------------------------
# Byte-identical to the tracked Violet969-PLM_Sol-3589a95/ tree.
PLM_Sol-V1.1.zip

# --- Large third-party binaries: retrieve, do not redistribute -------------
# InterProt SAE weights, 40 MB.  Download step + SHA-256 in REPO_SETUP.md.
interprot_ref/raw/*.safetensors

# PLM_Sol's own trained protT5 model, 28 MB.  Not used anywhere in our
# analysis; retrieval step in REPO_SETUP.md.
Violet969-PLM_Sol-3589a95/model_param/model_param.t7

# --- DeepLoc 2.0 raw data: no stated redistribution terms ------------------
# Download URLs + SHA-256 in REPO_SETUP.md and FINDINGS.md.
DeepLoc2/raw/*.csv
